      "notes": "VRAM byte and table reservations and whole-bank claims are transactional since dbec2fa: sat_vdp2_plan_begin/reserve/reserve_at/commit/rollback/release plus per-bank telemetry, over the byte free list which stays the single byte owner (sat_vdp2_plan_*). Not yet part of the transaction: CRAM ranges (still the non-transactional bank ring) and the cycle patterns (still planned inside sat_vdp2_layer_configure). E08 vdp2_vram_stress demonstrates every refusal path live."
